      "required_content": [],
      "writing_rules": { "structure": "boilerplate" },
      "boilerplate": "It is hereby declared that the installation described above has been carried out and verified in accordance with the requirements of the Regulation on Electrical Low Voltage Installations (FEL) and NEK 400. The installation is handed over in safe and compliant condition.",
      "boilerplate_no": "Det erklæres herved at anlegget beskrevet ovenfor er utført og kontrollert i samsvar med kravene i forskrift om elektriske lavspenningsanlegg (FEL) og NEK 400. Anlegget er overlevert i forskriftsmessig stand.",
